From 71942f0081c30b93d0135840fd1f6744de07da07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 02:42:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Praying no longer drops what you were attacking

Corey's call, 2026-09-21, and a deliberate divergence from upstream.

p_clearpendingaction nulls Player.target, so turning a prayer on stopped you
attacking - half of "actions get cancelled for doing anything". It is gone from
all eighteen prayer scripts.

Upstream had evidence for it: clarity.rs2 cited three pieces of period footage.
That is why this went to Corey rather than being tidied away, and why the three
videos stay in clarity.rs2 beside the decision - the trade was Old School feel
against 2006 authenticity, and the next reader should be able to see what was
given up rather than find a line missing.

combat_battery group 4 pinned the old behaviour yesterday and pins the new one
now, reading EXECUTABLE lines only - every one of these files still says the
words in a comment, and a check that matched those would go red on its own
explanation. Its mutation is the interrupt coming back, which is exactly what
an upstream merge would do to these files without anyone noticing.

Six mutations, each caught by its own check. rs2check 0 ERROR 0 CHECK, eleven
batteries ALL PASS. Not compiled: npm is still 403ing zod.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dc7giZ7Qnh4qy1CYPTDrmH
